---
// Four log lines of ONE request (X-Request-ID demo-7f3a), copied from the
// capture of the two services' output: two from evidence-lab, two from clue-api.
// The shared id is the red part; it is the only thing joining the two files.
const W = 900, H = 330;
const rows = [
  { ts: '17:21:28.882', svc: 'evidence-lab', icon: 'detective', en: 'analysis started', vi: 'analysis started' },
  { ts: '17:21:28.934', svc: 'evidence-lab', icon: 'detective', en: 'GET /analyze/C-1 → 200 · 53.0 ms', vi: 'GET /analyze/C-1 → 200 · 53.0 ms' },
  { ts: '17:21:28.935', svc: 'clue-api', icon: 'fastapi', en: 'httpx: GET …/analyze/C-1 200 OK', vi: 'httpx: GET …/analyze/C-1 200 OK' },
  { ts: '17:21:28.936', svc: 'clue-api', icon: 'fastapi', en: 'GET /cases/C-1/report → 200 · 64.4 ms', vi: 'GET /cases/C-1/report → 200 · 64.4 ms' },
];
---
<figure class="bep10b">
  <div class="bep10b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Four log lines from two services, sorted by time. Each carries the same request id demo-7f3a, drawn in red. Two come from evidence-lab and two from clue-api.">
    <text x="40" y="30" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>one request, two services, one id</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một request, hai service, một id</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="60" class="hd"><tspan data-lang-en>time</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giờ</tspan></text>
    <text x="170" y="60" class="hd"><tspan data-lang-en>service</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>service</tspan></text>
    <text x="330" y="60" class="hd"><tspan data-lang-en>what it logged</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nội dung log</tspan></text>
    <text x="770" y="60" class="hd"><tspan data-lang-en>request_id</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request_id</tspan></text>
    <line x1="40" y1="72" x2="860" y2="72" class="axis" />
    {rows.map((r, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x="40" y={110 + i * 56} class="ts">{r.ts}</text>
        <image href={`/icons/flow/${r.icon}.svg`} x={168} y={110 + i * 56 - 21} width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true" />
        <text x="202" y={110 + i * 56} class="svc"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.svc}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.svc}</tspan></text>
        <text x="330" y={110 + i * 56} class="msg"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi}</tspan></text>
        <text x="770" y={110 + i * 56} class="id"><tspan data-lang-en>demo-7f3a</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>demo-7f3a</tspan></text>
        {i < rows.length - 1 && <line x1="40" y1={110 + i * 56 + 22} x2="860" y2={110 + i * 56 + 22} class="sep" />}
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="40" y="314" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>the caller sent X-Request-ID once; the httpx hook forwarded it, so the second service logged the same value</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>caller gửi X-Request-ID một lần; hook của httpx chuyển tiếp nó, nên service thứ hai log đúng giá trị đó</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Lines copied from the two services' real output. Sort both files by request_id and the request reads as one story.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các dòng này chép từ output thật của hai service. Lọc cả hai file theo request_id là request hiện ra thành một câu chuyện.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep10b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep10b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep10b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep10b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep10b .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep10b .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep10b .svc { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep10b .id { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .bep10b .ts { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep10b .note { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep10b .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep10b .sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 0.8; }
  .bep10b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
